# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim).
# Played by audio/jingles.js: game/flow.js settleIn, the first time at depth 1 in a world.
title    Act I: Childhood
composer Claude
about    The first memories, under the sky: the toy tune whole on crystal (A B C, E D, C), over a harp and glass harmonica chords turning from A minor to C major, wind chimes, and the bird's wide call.
tempo    84
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.5

# mood explore: lead bird harp harm bass chimes

voice lead     crystal    vol=0.78 pan=-0.1
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.75
voice harp     harp       vol=0.42 pan=0.25
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.24 pan=-0.2 center=A4 att=0.2 rel=1
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.6
voice chimes   chimes     vol=0.36 pan=-0.35

# Am G C
pattern whole
lead    | A4--- B4- C5----- | E5----- D5----- | C5----------- |
harp    | A2- E3- A3- B3- C4- E4- | G2- D3- G3- A3- B3- D4- | C3- G3- C4- D4- E4- G4- |
harm    | [Am]?----------- | [G]?----------- | [C]----------- |
bass    | C2----------- | B1----------- | E2----------- |
bird    | _ | _ | .----- G6 C6+D6---- |
chimes  | x..... ...... | _ | x..x.. ...... |

loop whole
